ophila spermatogenesis involves the mutually dependent function of aly and a novel meiotic arrest gene cookie monster.</article-title><source>Development</source><volume>130</volume><fpage>563</fpage><lpage>573</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12490562</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0003009-Perez1"><label>26</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Perez</surname><given-names>DE</given-names></name><name><surname>Wu</surname><given-names>C-I</given-names></name><name><surname>Johnson</surname><given-names>NA</given-names></name><name><surname>Wu</surname><given-names>M-L</given-names></name></person-group><year>1993</year><article-title>Genetics of reproductive isolation in the <italic>Drosophila simulans</italic> clade: DNA marker-assisted mapping and characterization of a hybrid-male sterility gene, Odysseus (Ods).</article-title><source>Genetics</source><volume>134</volume><fpage>261</fpage><lpage>275</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8514135</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0003009-Wu1"><label>27</label><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wu</surname><given-names>C-I</given-names></name><name><surname>Perez</surname><given-names>DE</given-names></name><name><surname>Davis</surname><given-names>AW</given-names></name><name><surname>Johnson</surname><given-names>NA</given-names></name><name><surname>Cabot</surname><given-names>EL</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>1992</year><article-title>Molecular genetic studies of postmating reproductive isolation in Drosophila.</article-title><person-group person-group-type="editor"><name><surname>Takahata</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Clark</surname><given-names>AG</given-names></name></person-group><source>Molecular Paleo-population Biology</source><publisher-loc>Berlin</publisher-loc><publisher-name>Springer-Verlag</publisher-name><fpage>191</fpage><lpage>212</l